-- C25 example: CO2 storage (compositional CO2STORE core) with FE geomechanics, fault mechanics and fracture growth.
--   GEOMECH   two-way sequential FE geomechanics: pore volume and permeability of the CO2STORE cells follow the FE
--             porosity / stress after every report step (mole-conservative); stress, strain, uplift and failure maps
--   FAULTMECH a vertical fault F1 at x = 50 m (between columns 10 and 11) with the FE stress change (STRESSFIELD ... FE):
--             Coulomb stress, Dieterich seismicity, two-way fault permeability
--   HFGROW    the injection fracture HF1 (bottom layers) grows towards the fault by LEFM against the FE minimum stress
--             (tight 2 mD formation, 40000 sm3/d, BHP limit 230 bar; poro-elastic stressing arrests the growth)
-- OPM Flow ignores the '-- RESSIM:' lines.
-- base: CO2 storage in a brine aquifer (OPM Flow CO2STORE format, after opm-tests co2store/CO2STORE.DATA)
-- 2-D vertical section 100 m x 100 m, CO2 injected at the bottom; the plume rises, spreads under the top
-- and dissolves into the brine. In OPM CO2STORE decks the OIL phase is the brine.
-- Runs on the ResSim CO2STORE core (Spycher-Pruess / Duan-Sun) and on OPM Flow.
RUNSPEC
TITLE
CO2 storage + FE geomechanics + fault + fracture growth (C25)
DIMENS
 20 1 20 /
OIL
GAS
CO2STORE
METRIC
START
 1 'JAN' 2025 /
WELLDIMS
 1 20 1 1 /
FAULTDIM
 1 /
TABDIMS
 1 1 40 20 /
UNIFOUT

GRID
DX
 400*5 /
DY
 400*100 /
DZ
 400*5 /
TOPS
 20*1000 /
PORO
 400*0.3 /
PERMX
 400*2 /
PERMY
 400*2 /
PERMZ
 400*0.2 /
-- open lateral boundary: large pore volume in the last column (aquifer support)
MULTPV
 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 19*1 1e4 /

FAULTS
 'F1' 10 10 1 1 1 20 'X' /
/
-- RESSIM: GEOMECH ON 1 5e+09 0.25 1 1e-05 0 2 1 1 500 300 300 5e+09 0.25 1e-05 1 22600 0.5 1e+06 30 5e+05 4 0.0001 1e-08
-- RESSIM: HFRAC HF1 0.5 50 60 50 1085 1100 0.002 0 0.5 0 0
-- RESSIM: HFGROW HF1 0.5 160 0.1 6 1 FESTRESS
-- RESSIM: STRESSFIELD 0.226 0.7 0.95 30 0.5 0 FE
-- RESSIM: FAULTMECH F1 0.6 0 0 100 5 1.0 -1.0 5

PROPS
ROCK
 200 1e-6 /
SGOF
 0     0      1      0
 0.05  0      0.85   0
 0.2   0.03   0.55   0
 0.4   0.15   0.25   0
 0.6   0.35   0.07   0
 0.8   0.6    0      0
 1.0   1.0    0      0
/
SALINITY
 0.7 /   -- mol NaCl / kg H2O (~ 39 000 ppm)

SOLUTION
EQUIL
-- datum  p(bar) WOC  Pc   GOC   Pc
 1000    100    1100  0    900   0   1 1 0 /
RTEMPVD
 1000 50
 1200 50
/
RSVD
 1000 0
 1200 0
/

SUMMARY
FPR
FGIP
FGIT
FGIR

SCHEDULE
WELSPECS
 'INJ' 'G1' 1 1 1* 'GAS' /
/
COMPDAT
 'INJ' 1 1 18 20 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
/
WCONINJE
 'INJ' 'GAS' 'OPEN' 'RATE' 40000 1* 230 /
/
TSTEP
 12*30.4 /
WCONINJE
 'INJ' 'GAS' 'SHUT' 'RATE' 0 1* 230 /
/
TSTEP
 12*30.4 24*91.3 /
END
